    [Doc][Feature] Update A2 deployment for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash (#19586)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash deployment guide for Atlas 800
    A2 servers. Specifically, it:
    - Adjusts the `--max-num-batched-tokens` parameter from 8192 to 4096 in
    the Prefill node scripts.
    - Updates the A2 series hardware configuration from a four-node setup to
    a two-node colocated configuration (DP2/TP8/EP).Enhances the multi-node
    colocated deployment command for A2 series with advanced configurations
    such as prefix caching, async scheduling, and engram config.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: ylyhyqsl <18811318716@163.com>

